    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a basement room, bound, with a camera staring you down. A deranged masked man entices his audience. You\u2019ve been abducted by a lunatic who thrives on chaos and carnage. His goal? To force you into a twisted game of luck while the entire internet watches in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make is broadcast live to a bloodthirsty audience. The stakes could not\u00a0be higher: each failure brings you closer to a gruesome demise, and the viewers seem eager to see you fail. Can you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to outsmart this madness, or will you become just another victim of the <i>Death Stream</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense puzzles and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nerve-wracking atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions and performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
